<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"> <html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="en"> <head> <title>MESSAGE BOARD</title> <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html;charset=utf-8" /> <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico" /> <style type="text/css"> body { margin: 0; padding: 12px; margin-bottom: auto; } blockquote blockquote { margin-left: 0em } form { margin-bottom: 0px } .postarea { text-align: center } .postarea table { margin: 0px auto; text-align: left } .thumb { border: none; float: left; margin: 2px 20px } .nothumb { float: left; background: #eee; border: 2px dashed #aaa; text-align: center; margin: 2px 20px; padding: 1em 0.5em 1em 0.5em; } .reply blockquote, blockquote :last-child { margin-bottom: 0em } .reflink a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none } .reply .filesize { margin-left: 20px } .userdelete { float: right; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap } .replypage .replylink { display: none } </style>  <link rel="alternate stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/board/css/burichan.css" title="Burichan" />  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/board/css/futaba.css" title="Futaba" />  <link rel="alternate stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/board/css/gurochan.css" title="Gurochan" />  <link rel="alternate stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/board/css/photon.css" title="Photon" />  <script type="text/javascript">var style_cookie="wakabastyle";</script> <script type="text/javascript" src="/board/kareha.js"></script> <script type="text/javascript">require_script_version("3.a");</script> </head>  <body class="mainpage"> <div class="adminbar">  [<a href="javascript:set_stylesheet('Burichan')">Burichan</a>]  [<a href="javascript:set_stylesheet('Futaba')">Futaba</a>]  [<a href="javascript:set_stylesheet('Gurochan')">Gurochan</a>]  [<a href="javascript:set_stylesheet('Photon')">Photon</a>]  - [<a href="/board/.." target="_top">Home</a>] </div> <div class="logo"> <img src="/content/img/piratebox-logo-small.png" alt="SLAVA UKRAINI MESSAGE BOARD" />  <br /> SLAVA UKRAINI MESSAGE BOARD </div><hr />  <div class="postarea"> <form id="postform" action="/board/kareha.pl" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data"> <input type="hidden" name="task" value="post" />  <table><tbody> <tr><td class="postblock">Name</td><td><input type="text" name="field_a" size="28" /></td></tr> <tr><td class="postblock">Link</td><td><input type="text" name="field_b" size="28" /></td></tr> <tr><td class="postblock">Subject</td><td><input type="text" name="title" size="35" /> <input type="submit" value="Submit" /></td></tr> <tr><td class="postblock">Comment</td><td><textarea name="comment" cols="48" rows="4"></textarea></td></tr>  <tr><td class="postblock">File</td><td><input type="file" name="file" size="35" /> </td></tr>   <tr><td class="postblock">Password</td><td><input type="password" name="password" size="8" /> (for post and file deletion)</td></tr>  <tr style="display:none"> <td class="postblock">Leave empty (spam trap): </td> <td><input type="text" name="name" size="10" autocomplete="off" /><input type="text" name="link" size="10" autocomplete="off" /></td> </tr>  <tr><td colspan="2"> <div class="rules"><ul> <li>Supported file types are: 7Z, AAC, BZ2, FLA, FLAC, GIF, GZ, IT, JPG, LHA, LZH, M4A, M4V, MO3, MOD, MP3, MP4, MPC, MPP, NSF, OGG, PNG, RAR, SID, SPC, SWF, TORRENT, WEBM, XM, ZIP</li> <li>Maximum file size allowed is 5000 KB.</li> <li>Images greater than 200x200 pixels will be thumbnailed.</li> </ul></div></td></tr> </tbody></table></form></div> <script type="text/javascript">set_new_inputs("postform")</script>  <hr /> <form id="delform" action="/board/kareha.pl" method="post">     <a name="1"></a> <label><input type="checkbox" name="delete" value="1790851453,1" /> <span class="filetitle">webm and mp4s</span>  <span class="postername">/k/aitilyn</span><span class="postertrip"> ADMIN/OWNER</span> 26/10/01(Thu)10:44 ID:6nPLQs3x</label> <span class="reflink"> <a href="javascript:w_insert('&gt;&gt;1','/board/kareha.pl/1790851453/')">No.1</a> </span>&nbsp; <span class="replylink">[<a href="/board/kareha.pl/1790851453/" id="reply1790851453">Reply</a>]</span> <blockquote> <p>webm and mp4 files should now work and load thanks to AI </p> </blockquote>        <table><tbody><tr><td class="doubledash">&gt;&gt;</td> <td class="reply" id="reply2"> <a name="2"></a> <label><input type="checkbox" name="delete" value="1790851453,2" /> <span class="replytitle"></span>  <span class="commentpostername">/k/aitilyn</span><span class="postertrip"> ADMIN/OWNER</span> 26/10/01(Thu)10:46 ID:6nPLQs3x</label> <span class="reflink"> <a href="javascript:w_insert('&gt;&gt;2','/board/kareha.pl/1790851453/')">No.2</a> </span>&nbsp;  <blockquote> <p>next fix is dual band wifi this most likely will end up via a router as dont think hostapd can do two bands at the same time </p> </blockquote> </td></tr></tbody></table>     <br clear="left" /><hr />     <span class="filesize">File: <a target="_blank" href="/board/src/1790851122421.gif">1790851122421.gif</a> -(<em>2349210 B, 400x248</em>)</span> <span class="thumbnailmsg">Thumbnail displayed, click image for full size.</span><br />    <a target="_blank" href="/board/src/1790851122421.gif"> <img src="/board/src/1790851122421.gif" width="200" height="124" alt="2349210" class="thumb" /></a>     <a name="1"></a> <label><input type="checkbox" name="delete" value="1790851122,1" /> <span class="filetitle">testing </span>  <span class="postername">/k/aitilyn</span><span class="postertrip"> ADMIN/OWNER</span> 26/10/01(Thu)10:38 ID:6nPLQs3x</label> <span class="reflink"> <a href="javascript:w_insert('&gt;&gt;1','/board/kareha.pl/1790851122/')">No.1</a> </span>&nbsp; <span class="replylink">[<a href="/board/kareha.pl/1790851122/" id="reply1790851122">Reply</a>]</span> <blockquote>  </blockquote>      <br clear="left" /><hr />     <a name="1"></a> <label><input type="checkbox" name="delete" value="1694598562,1" /> <span class="filetitle"></span>  <span class="postername">/k/aitilyn</span><span class="postertrip"> ADMIN/OWNER</span> 23/09/13(Wed)09:49 ID:ejK4rnlY</label> <span class="reflink"> <a href="javascript:w_insert('&gt;&gt;1','/board/kareha.pl/1694598562/')">No.1</a> </span>&nbsp; <span class="replylink">[<a href="/board/kareha.pl/1694598562/" id="reply1694598562">Reply</a>]</span> <blockquote> <p>hello world</p> </blockquote>      <br clear="left" /><hr />     <a name="1"></a> <label><input type="checkbox" name="delete" value="1691080191,1" /> <span class="filetitle"></span>  <span class="postername">anon</span><span class="postertrip"> ADMIN/OWNER</span> 23/08/03(Thu)16:29 ID:b3bMEynj</label> <span class="reflink"> <a href="javascript:w_insert('&gt;&gt;1','/board/kareha.pl/1691080191/')">No.1</a> </span>&nbsp; <span class="replylink">[<a href="/board/kareha.pl/1691080191/" id="reply1691080191">Reply</a>]</span> <blockquote> <p>Hello</p> </blockquote>      <br clear="left" /><hr />     <a name="1"></a> <label><input type="checkbox" name="delete" value="1691080185,1" /> <span class="filetitle"></span>  <span class="postername">anon</span><span class="postertrip"> ADMIN/OWNER</span> 23/08/03(Thu)16:29 ID:b3bMEynj</label> <span class="reflink"> <a href="javascript:w_insert('&gt;&gt;1','/board/kareha.pl/1691080185/')">No.1</a> </span>&nbsp; <span class="replylink">[<a href="/board/kareha.pl/1691080185/" id="reply1691080185">Reply</a>]</span> <blockquote> <p>Hello</p> </blockquote>      <br clear="left" /><hr />     <a name="1"></a> <label><input type="checkbox" name="delete" value="1653042534,1" /> <span class="filetitle"></span>  <span class="postername">anon</span><span class="postertrip"> ADMIN/OWNER</span> 22/05/20(Fri)10:28 ID:hISX+CAZ</label> <span class="reflink"> <a href="javascript:w_insert('&gt;&gt;1','/board/kareha.pl/1653042534/')">No.1</a> </span>&nbsp; <span class="replylink">[<a href="/board/kareha.pl/1653042534/" id="reply16530425